     component-scoped CSS: a large amount of this admin panel's markup
     (the Work table, tag chips, item pickers, ...) is generated client-side
     via innerHTML, and elements created that way never receive the
     data-astro-cid attribute scoped CSS relies on to match — so a scoped
     rule silently never applies to anything rendered dynamically. Nothing
     on this page shares components or class names with the public site, so
     going global here has no collision risk. */
